{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>התיטבי</b> — Let it be good." "<b>מנוא אמון</b> — Name of a city in the land of Egypt, which the king of Chaldea captured when he went to Nineveh." "<b>אשר חיל ים</b> — And she has strength from the sea, for she has no need for a wall. And this is the Sea of Reeds or the Sea of Sefarad, which is called the Great Sea, corresponding to the seas of the land of Israel."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:47.005276411Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}